/// inconsistencies on the volume. Volume events notify you if this occurs.
/// Volume actions notify you if any action needs to be taken in response to
/// the event. The DescribeVolumeStatus operation provides the following
/// information about the specified volumes: Status : Reflects the current
/// status of the volume. The possible values are ok , impaired , warning ,
/// or insufficient-data . If all checks pass, the overall status of the
/// volume is ok . If the check fails, the overall status is impaired . If
/// the status is insufficient-data , then the checks might still be taking
/// place on your volume at the time. We recommend that you retry the
